{
  "scope": "Actual isolated upstream config parser, production binary dotenv bypass, and pinned NATS 2.14.5 config_digest through HTTP and authenticated system VARZ before and after reload. A bounded static-profile loader projects credential-free effective permissions for named password/nkey users and rejects unreviewed auth paths. Conservative queue, JetStream API, ACK, KV, control-subject and system-account classification is compared with real durable fetch, purge, request/reply injection and core run delivery. Read-only system observations bind VARZ and one complete bounded authenticated CONNZ snapshot to named brokers, plus a timed PING.IDZ comparison with the operator broker list; they cannot prove broker or credential-holder census completeness. This does not establish Kubernetes authority, stored-proof verification or distributed activation.",
